        <mxCell id="node_scheduler" value="&lt;b style='color:#000000; font-size:13px;'&gt;FRACTIONAL SCHEDULER &amp;amp; MEMORY GUARD&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style='color:#222222; font-size:11px;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;Bounded C++ ThreadPool (2–4 Active Slots)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Strictly prevents RAM spikes on 16GB system&lt;br/&gt;• Non-blocking std::future&amp;lt;AgentResult&amp;gt; promises&lt;br/&gt;• Lazy model loading: loads weights only when active&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8f9fa;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="zone_runtime">
